flowchart TB
    Clients["Clients"]
    ACM["ACM certificate"]
    S3["Private S3 bucket"]
    ECR["ECR image registry"]
    Secrets["Secrets Manager"]
    CW["CloudWatch logs and metrics"]
    SSM["Systems Manager"]

    subgraph Region["AWS Region"]
        subgraph VPC["NOVIQ VPC across two Availability Zones"]
            IGW["Internet Gateway"]
            ALB["HTTPS ALB across public subnets"]

            subgraph AZA["Availability Zone A"]
                PubA["Public subnet A"]
                NAT_A["NAT Gateway A"]
                subgraph AppSubnetA["Private application subnet A"]
                    API_A["EC2 API ASG instance"]
                    WorkerA["EC2 Celery worker"]
                    Beat["EC2 singleton Celery Beat"]
                end
                subgraph DataSubnetA["Private data subnet A"]
                    DataA["RDS and Redis subnet placement"]
                end
            end

            subgraph AZB["Availability Zone B"]
                PubB["Public subnet B"]
                NAT_B["NAT Gateway B"]
                subgraph AppSubnetB["Private application subnet B"]
                    API_B["EC2 API ASG instance"]
                    WorkerB["EC2 Celery worker capacity"]
                end
                subgraph DataSubnetB["Private data subnet B"]
                    DataB["RDS and Redis subnet placement"]
                end
            end

            RDS["Private RDS PostgreSQL Multi-AZ"]
            Redis["Private ElastiCache Redis"]
            S3EP["S3 gateway VPC endpoint"]
            VPCE["Optional ECR, CloudWatch, Secrets Manager, and SSM interface endpoints"]
        end
    end

    Clients -->|HTTPS| IGW
    IGW --> ALB
    ALB -. deployed in .-> PubA
    ALB -. deployed in .-> PubB
    ACM -. certificate .-> ALB
    ALB --> API_A
    ALB --> API_B

    RDS -. subnet group .-> DataA
    RDS -. subnet group .-> DataB
    Redis -. subnet group .-> DataA
    Redis -. subnet group .-> DataB

    API_A --> RDS
    API_B --> RDS
    WorkerA --> RDS
    WorkerB --> RDS
    Beat --> RDS

    API_A --> Redis
    API_B --> Redis
    WorkerA --> Redis
    WorkerB --> Redis
    Beat --> Redis

    API_A --> S3EP
    API_B --> S3EP
    WorkerA --> S3EP
    WorkerB --> S3EP
    S3EP --> S3
    Clients -. short-lived presigned URL .-> S3

    API_A --> VPCE
    API_B --> VPCE
    WorkerA --> VPCE
    WorkerB --> VPCE
    Beat --> VPCE
    VPCE --> ECR
    Secrets --> API_A
    Secrets --> API_B
    Secrets --> WorkerA
    Secrets --> WorkerB
    Secrets --> Beat
    CW --> VPCE
    SSM --> VPCE

    AppSubnetA -. private egress route .-> NAT_A
    AppSubnetB -. private egress route .-> NAT_B
    NAT_A --> IGW
    NAT_B --> IGW
